+ * call with `if (msync_mring_on)` so a disabled ring costs one predictable branch. */
+/* 1-4 are the wait/signal path. 10+ mark the branches added by the 2026-08-07
+ * msync work, each of which is silent in production (WINEDEBUG=-all kills ERR)
+ * and any of which could explain the Steam webhelper regression: they fire only
+ * in cases the conformance suite does not reach. Recorded rather than reasoned
+ * about, so a live Steam session says which -- if any -- is actually taken. */
